<title>USA: Fairfield Cty, S.C., won by NationsBanc.</title>
<headline>Fairfield Cty, S.C., won by NationsBanc.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>NationsBanc Capital Markets said it won $4.500</p>
<p>million of Fairfield Cty, S.C., general obligation bonds, Series 1996, with a</p>
<p>net interest cost of 5.27 percent.</p>
<p>AMT: 4,500,000	DATE: 09/25/96	NYC Time: 1200	CUSIP: 304293</p>
<p>ISSUER: Fairfield County						ST: SC</p>
